WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:17.176
"Hurry up!" Harry told his family.

2
00:00:17.177 --> 00:00:26.753
"I can't be late for my school play."

3
00:00:26.754 --> 00:00:35.086
They were still getting ready.

4
00:00:35.087 --> 00:00:40.876
At last everyone ran out to the car.

5
00:00:40.877 --> 00:00:46.163
"Wait for me!" cried Aunt Judy.

6
00:00:46.164 --> 00:00:50.111
Dad drove down the street.

7
00:00:50.112 --> 00:00:54.292
"Did you remember the tickets?" asked Mom.

8
00:00:54.293 --> 00:01:00.726
"Whoops," said Dad.

9
00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:05.846
Dad turned the car around and drove back home.

10
00:01:05.847 --> 00:01:12.451
Dad ran into the house.

11
00:01:12.452 --> 00:01:18.854
Oliver cried, "I have to go to the bathroom!"

12
00:01:18.855 --> 00:01:25.971
"Let's go," said Mom.

13
00:01:25.972 --> 00:01:32.807
"Hurry!" said Harry.

14
00:01:32.808 --> 00:01:40.743
Mom, Dad, and Oliver were back soon.

15
00:01:40.744 --> 00:01:44.494
They were almost at the school when Harry gasped.

16
00:01:44.495 --> 00:01:52.386
"I forgot my turtle costume!" he said.

17
00:01:52.387 --> 00:01:56.235
Dad stopped the car and turned around.

18
00:01:56.237 --> 00:02:01.538
Mom ran into the house for the costume.

19
00:02:01.539 --> 00:02:07.034
"Did anyone else forget anything?" Dad asked.

20
00:02:07.035 --> 00:02:11.533
Oliver and Emmy shook their heads.

21
00:02:11.534 --> 00:02:16.076
"Not me," said Aunt Judy.

22
00:02:16.077 --> 00:02:20.165
Mom got back in the car.

23
00:02:20.166 --> 00:02:28.824
"Okay, let's go," she said, looking at her watch.

24
00:02:28.825 --> 00:02:33.694
Soon they were at the school.

25
00:02:33.695 --> 00:02:37.856
"Have fun, Harry," said Mom.

26
00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:41.432
Harry went backstage.

27
00:02:41.433 --> 00:02:52.687
The rest of the family went to their seats.

28
00:02:52.688 --> 00:03:01.206
A minute later the play started.

29
00:03:01.207 --> 00:03:05.791
"Oh, Harry looks adorable," said Mom.

30
00:03:05.792 --> 00:03:10.714
"Honey, take some pictures."

31
00:03:10.715 --> 00:03:13.951
"Uh-oh," said Dad.

32
00:03:13.952 --> 00:03:16.930
"What's wrong?" asked Mom.

33
00:03:16.931 --> 00:03:24.592
"I forgot the camera!" said Dad.
